   "name": "David Martin-Robinson",
   "pos": "TE",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-17T01:55Z",
   "shortComment": "Martin-Robinson (hamstring) does not have any injury designation ahead of Sunday's game against the Colts.",
   "longComment": "Martin-Robinson upgraded to a full participant in Friday's practice after being limited to start Week 6 prep. The tight end is all set to suit up behind Gunnar Helm and Daniel Bellinger as the No. 3 tight end for the Titans' offense while also serving on special teams.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "642821",
   "name": "Amani Hooker",
   "pos": "S",
