   "date": "2026-10-17T01:53Z",
   "shortComment": "Hooker (concussion) does not have any injury designation ahead of Sunday's game against the Colts.",
   "longComment": "Hooker has cleared the NFL's five-step concussion protocol and is set to suit up in Sunday's game. The starting safety missed the Titans' Week 5 loss to the Texans due to the injury.",
