  {
   "id": "642471",
   "name": "Cor'Dale Flott",
   "pos": "CB",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-14T23:12Z",
   "shortComment": "Flott (chest) was a full participant in Wednesday's practice session.",
   "longComment": "Flott exited the Titans' Week 5 loss to the Texans early with a chest injury. The cornerback returned to the contest briefly after sustaining the chest injury before exiting again for the remainder of the night. Despite the injury, the 25-year-old is fully back in action just a few short days after the incident.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "642389",
   "name": "Elic Ayomanor",
   "pos": "WR",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-14T02:41Z",
   "shortComment": "Ayomanor caught one of two passes for 17 yards during the Titans' 26-3 loss to the Texans on Sunday. He also added a tackle on special teams.",
   "longComment": "It was the fourth time in five games this season that Ayomanor caught one pass, with his lone connection with Cam Ward on Sunday coming late in the fourth quarter. Ayomanor was on the field for 33 of the Titans' 63 offensive snaps (52.4 percent), which was fourth-most among Tennessee wide receivers behind Carnell Tate (48), Wan'Dale Robinson (47) and Calvin Ridley (35). The Titans' 11.6 points per game is lowest in the NFL, so it's hard to put much stock into Ayomanor or any of the team's skill-position players heading into Week 6 against the Colts on Oct. 18.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "642269",
   "name": "Calvin Ridley",
   "pos": "WR",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-13T01:31Z",
   "shortComment": "Ridley caught two of three targets for 33 yards during Sunday's 26-3 loss to the Texans.",
   "longComment": "Ridley was limited to two or fewer catches for the fifth straight game to open the regular season, and he has yet to exceed 35 receiving yards in a contest this year. The wide receiver has reeled in five of eight targets for 81 yards this season, and he'll continue to have a rather low floor from a fantasy perspective in Week 6 against the Colts.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "642257",
   "name": "Gunnar Helm",
   "pos": "TE",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-13T00:21Z",
   "shortComment": "Helm failed to catch his only target during Sunday's 26-3 loss to the Texans.",
   "longComment": "Helm failed to catch a pass in a regular-season contest for the first time in his NFL career, and the tight end has now garnered two total targets over the last two games. The Titans offense has been far from effective so far in 2026, and Helm has little to no upside from a fantasy perspective.",
   "details": null
